-06","source_fetched_at":"2026-08-13","latitude":null,"longitude":null,"maps_url":null,"access_notes":"Route, timing and viewing access are set annually by Homecoming organizers.","cost_status":"unknown","under21_safe":true},{"subject_id":"uf-gator-wrap-ring","subject_type":"tradition","entity_name":"Gator Wrap Ring","title":"Recognize the Gator Wrap","subtitle":"Student and alumni ring tradition","notes":"View the Alumni Association’s ring history and design before deciding whether this long-running student-and-alumni tradition is meaningful to you.","short_summary":"A distinctive UF ring tradition dating to the late 1930s.","evidence_claim":"The UF Alumni Association says the Gator Wrap has been a tradition among UF students and alumni since the late 1930s.","source_url":"https://connect.ufalumni.ufl.edu/students/gator-pride/gator-wrap-ring","source_title":"Gator Wrap Ring","source_kind":"university_official","source_published_at":null,"source_fetched_at":"2026-08-13","latitude":null,"longitude":null,"maps_url":null,"access_notes":"A ring is optional merchandise; consult the official program for current ordering details.","cost_status":"purchase_required","under21_safe":true},{"subject_id":"uf-holiday-gator","subject_type":"tradition","entity_name":"Holiday Gator","title":"Spot the Holiday Gator","subtitle":"Seasonal orange-and-blue campus installation","notes":"During the winter holiday season, check UF announcements before visiting the University Auditorium lawn to view the illuminated steel alligator.","short_summary":"A seasonal campus sculpture tradition that began in 2019.","evidence_claim":"UF News described the Holiday Gator as a new annual tradition: an orange-and-blue illuminated steel alligator near University Auditorium.","source_url":"https://news.ufl.edu/2020/11/holiday-gator/","source_title":"Holiday Gator to return to UF","source_kind":"university_official","source_published_at":"2020-11-20","source_fetched_at":"2026-08-13","latitude":null,"longitu